---
import { SITE_TITLE } from "../consts";
const today = new Date();
---

<footer class="border-t border-black/10 dark:border-white/10 mt-20 py-12">
	<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
		<div class="col-span-2">
			<h2
				class="m3-headline-large italic leading-none text-black dark:text-white mb-4"
			>
				{SITE_TITLE.toUpperCase()}
			</h2>
			<p
				class="m3-body-medium text-black dark:text-white max-w-md leading-relaxed"
			>
				Faint Signals is a personal blog exploring the
				margins of technology, design, and culture. A collection of 
				late-stage insights, raw signals, and personal observations.
				Opinions are my own.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div>
			<h3
				class="m3-label-medium text-black dark:text-white mb-4 uppercase tracking-widest"
			>
				Network
			</h3>
			<ul class="m3-label-large space-y-2 text-black dark:text-white">
				<li>
					<a
						href="/"
						class="hover:underline opacity-80 hover:opacity-100"
						>LATEST SIGNALS</a
					>
				</li>
				<li>
					<a
						href="/archives"
						class="hover:underline opacity-80 hover:opacity-100"
						>ARCHIVES (ALL SIGNALS)</a
					>
				</li>
				<li>
					<a
						href="/tags"
						class="hover:underline opacity-80 hover:opacity-100"
						>TOPIC INDEX</a
					>
				</li>
				<li>
					<a
						href="/about"
						class="hover:underline opacity-80 hover:opacity-100"
						>THE PROJECT (ABOUT)</a
					>
				</li>
				<li>
					<a
						href="/rss.xml"
						class="hover:underline opacity-80 hover:opacity-100"
						>RSS FEED</a
					>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
		<div>
			<h3
				class="m3-label-medium text-black dark:text-white mb-4 uppercase tracking-widest"
			>
				The Take
			</h3>
			<p
				class="m3-body-medium text-black dark:text-white italic leading-relaxed"
			>
				"Everything here is subject to change. Most signals are weak.
				Some are probably wrong. All are noted."
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div
		class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4 m3-label-small text-black dark:text-white uppercase tracking-widest"
	>
		<span>© {today.getFullYear()} {SITE_TITLE.toUpperCase()}</span>
		<span>BROADCASTING FROM THE NOISE</span>
	</div>
</footer>
